  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU-China Dialogue on Migration and Mobility Support Project &#x2013; Phase II (MMSP II)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The MMSPII aims at supporting Chinese and EU stakeholders in migration management matters as well as in providing an enabling environment for a productive approach to the EU-China Dialogue on Migration and Mobility. More specifically, its objectives centre around mobility and legal migration between the EU and China, as well as irregular migratory flows from the People&#x2019;s Republic of China (PRC) to the EU. Building on the fruitful results of the first phase, the second phase of the project is designed to focus on regular migration, irregular migration as well as migration policy and research.</narrative>
  </description>
